From 4179a4580055c00333406f4b2d17104599b8a524 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: will <will-tm@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 01:02:45 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 102/103] hw/usb: CI HDRC device-mode UDC for i.MX6SX

ChipIDEA controller in peripheral mode for the flintstone machine's
usb@02184000 (dr_mode=peripheral in the stock DT): register file per
the 4.1.15 chipidea driver contract, dQH/dTD transfer engine, setup
buffer DMA to QH0+0x28, ENDPTSETUPSTAT/ENDPTCOMPLETE/USBSTS interrupt
semantics, plus the imx-usbmisc register block and the usb0-hostchar
bridge to the host-side virtual USB host (docs/usb-host-bridge-protocol.md).

Stock kernel: ci_hdrc probes, g_mass_storage binds, /sys/class/udc/ci_hdrc.0
and lun0 appear; enumeration through SET_ADDRESS verified.
