+ * Address map and IRQ numbers are taken from the board's own Device Tree
+ * blob (stock firmware `fdt@3`, compatible "nestlabs,diamond3-dvt",
+ * "fsl,imx6sx"), NOT from the i.MX6 Quad map — the 6SX differs in several
+ * places (UART2-5 sit on AIPS2, there is a third AIPS bus at 0x02200000,
+ * the GPMI/BCH/APBH block lives at 0x01800000, and there is no PCIe).
